      "path": "src/coordinators/daily-review/daily-review.ts",
      "content": "When there are no walked Trades and the last due owed reflection is resolved, `assemble()` returns `Empty` (also when only not-yet-due reflections remain). `readAfterSave()` converts that to `ChangedDuringAssembly`, so this synthetic done progress is never reached and the save cannot return `nextStep: Done`, despite no concurrent change. Handle an `Empty` post-save assembly as a settled completed review so the final owed card's progress and Done step are returned. Add coverage for resolving the last due reflection with an empty walk.",
